# Cursor rules — pointer

Primary agent guidance lives in **`CLAUDE.md`** at the repo root. Read it before editing.

## Hard rules (do not violate, even for a one-line fix)

- **Never edit `src/tokens/*.json`.** Tokens Studio (Figma plugin) owns those files and will overwrite hand edits on the next push. If a value looks wrong, flag it — don't fix it here.
- **Never edit `dist/*.css`.** Auto-generated. Regenerate with `npm run build`.
- **Never `npm publish` locally.** CI handles releases.

## For depth

- Project overview + pipeline → `docs/project.md`
- Build scripts → `docs/scripts.md`
- Local workflow → `docs/contributing.md`
- Theming model (`--ds-*`, `--sa-*`, `data-*` axes) → `guidelines/parametric-theming.md`
- Anti-patterns → `guidelines/anti-patterns.md`
